a.c('live_fp_qualification','Live F_P qualification authority','Live tests are source-designated gold standard; every failure requires root cause rather than unexplained flaky/preexisting/environment labels.',[g(1,543)])
a.q('live_failure_diagnosis',['live_fp_qualification'],'Separate transport readiness/reliability, instruction/response-contract sufficiency and returned response/artifact conformance. Missing/malformed/incomplete/contradictory post-dispatch output remains typed response-admission truth, not rewritten as transport or solely prompt insufficiency. Transport must provide all dispatch operations; denied required read/write/command capability is transport failure, not agent quality. Transient network/rate-limit/unavailability retries are bounded count/backoff in transport; permanent missing-agent/auth failures are not retried.',[g(1,545,555)])
